<title>USA: $9.13 mln Hudson Cty, N.J. won by Ryan, Beck.</title>
<headline>$9.13 mln Hudson Cty, N.J. won by Ryan, Beck.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ryan, Beck &amp; Co said it won $9.13 million of Hudson County, N.J. Vocational school bonds, with a 5.05 coupon.</p>
</text>
